(290, 'Syed Salman', 'Rashid', 'info@graspsolutions.net', '+1-888-6133313', 'Hello,\r\n\r\nThis is Syed Salman Rashid, Director at Grasp Solutions Pvt Ltd. (Dispatch, Call Center & Digital Marketing Services Provider Company). I hope this email finds you well.\r\n\r\nWe specialize in Dispatch, Call Center & Digital Marketing services for Taxi/Limousine Companies. (PDF is Attached)\r\n\r\nOur Expertise:\r\nWe\'re proficient in using dispatch software like LimoAnyWhere, TaxiCaller, and iCabbi.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Us?\r\nBy opting for our services, you can trim in-house expenses and let our professional team manage your business more efficiently. Focus on business growth, while we handle potential operational complexities. We ensure 100% uptime with robust backup systems in place. \r\n\r\nWhat We Offer: \r\nOur team manages your complete dispatch operations, including answering calls, bookings, driver dispatch, driver support, and more. We can also create a customized monthly plan for you after discussing your specific needs and budget.\r\n\r\nInterested?\r\nIf you or anyone you know is interested, let\'s schedule a Google or Zoom meeting for further discussion.\r\n\r\nExplainer Video:\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PI9OnriWwtc\r\n\r\nWe\'re here to address your questions and provide more insights into our services.', '2024-10-08 01:49:34', '2024-10-08 01:49:34'),
