(494, 'Mike Aleksander Bakker', 'Mike Aleksander Bakker', 'info@hilkom-digital.com', '83664168337', 'Hi, \r\n \r\nIf you’re ready to boost your rankings, monthly SEO is the way forward. \r\n \r\nAt Hilkom Digital, we focus on results-driven growth through tailored SEO strategies. Our monthly plans are engineered for results and ideal for teams that want impactful ROI — not just numbers that look good but don’t convert. \r\n \r\nDue to strong client interest and our commitment to quality, we can only work with a limited number of clients each month. This ensures you get our full expertise. \r\n \r\n______________ \r\nMonthly Package Features: \r\n•	Complete technical & content SEO \r\n•	DA50+ backlink building \r\n•	Smart keyword focus and tracking \r\n•	Toxic link cleanup & disavow file handling \r\n•	Paid indexing for faster rankings \r\n•	International SEO options \r\n______________ \r\n \r\nAvailability is tight — secure your monthly SEO plan now: \r\nhttps://www.hilkom-digital.com/seo-services/ \r\n \r\nWant to talk first? Chat with an SEO expert here: \r\nhttps://www.hilkom-digital.com/whatsapp-us/ \r\n \r\nLet’s boost your digital presence, drive traffic, and grow your business — the results-first way. \r\n \r\nBest regards, \r\nMike Aleksander Bakker\r\n \r\nHilkom Digital \r\nPhone/WhatsApp: +1 (855) 221-7591 \r\nsupport@hilkom-digital.com', '2025-04-08 16:28:58', '2025-04-08 16:28:58');
