acious cabin provides ample seating for up to eight passengers, ensuring everyone travels in comfort and style.The Escalade is packed with cutting-edge technology and features that enhance convenience, connectivity, and safety. The Cadillac User Experience (CUE) infotainment system integrates seamlessly with your smartphone, providing access to navigation, music streaming, and hands-free calling. Advanced driver-assistance systems, such as adaptive cruise control, lane-keep assist, and automatic emergency braking, help keep you safe on the road.Versatility is another hallmark of the Escalade. With flexible seating configurations and generous cargo space, you have the freedom to adapt the interior to suit your needs. From family road trips to hauling large items, the Escalade accommodates your lifestyle with ease.Overall, the 2023 Cadillac Escalade represents the pinnacle of luxury SUVs. With its striking design, powerful performance, advanced technology, and exceptional comfort, the Escalade offers an unparalleled driving experience that truly stands out from the crowd.', '2023-08-21 17:05:46', '2023-11-12 12:19:38'),
